# No audio is committed here (bloom-in-tree.md §2.4). The recipes ship;
# whoever clones generates their own takes and chooses among them, so two
# people's bloom sounding different is the point rather than a cost. The
# shelves stay, because where audio *would* go is part of the layout.
songs/*/audio/**
!songs/*/audio/.gitkeep
shared/samples/**
!shared/samples/.gitkeep
